ui.aoc:info.nuclear_processor=Converts Thorium Concentrate into Actinide Solution.\n\nInput: 20 Thorium Concentrate\nOutput: 100 mB Actinide Solution\nEnergy: 50,000 KDe\n\nAccepted Upgrades:\n- Speed\n- Energy
ui.utilitycraft:info.fermenter=Converts organic inputs into fluids.\n\nSlots:\n- Inputs: seeds or sugar cane.\n- Fluid: produced liquid storage.\n- Output: optional residue.\n\nAccepted Upgrades:\n- Speed\n- Energy
ui.utilitycraft:info.fuel_mixer=Mixes stored fluids into fuel blends.\n\nStorage:\n- Inputs: recipe fluids.\n- Output: produced fuel.\n\nAccepted Upgrades:\n- Speed\n- Energy
ui.utilitycraft:info.separator=Separates one fluid into two output fluids.\n\nStorage:\n- Input: source fluid.\n- Outputs: separated fluids.\n\nAccepted Upgrades:\n- Speed\n- Energy
ui.utilitycraft:info.chemical_reactor=Processes one or more fluid inputs into a single main fluid product.\n\nStorage:\n- Inputs: recipe fluids.\n- Output: main product.\n\nAccepted Upgrades:\n- Speed\n- Energy
ui.aoc:info.polymerizer=Converts Plastic Resin into HDPE Pellets.\n\nInput: 250 mB Plastic Resin\nOutput: 1 HDPE Pellet\nEnergy: 10,000 KDe
ui.aoc:info.industrial_crusher=Processes items through selectable output stages.\n\nInput: 2x2 item grid.\nOutput: 3x3 result grid.\n\nStages:\n- 1x: First breakdown\n- 2x: Second breakdown\n- 3x: Third breakdown\n\nAccepted Upgrades:\n- Speed\n- Energy
ui.aoc:info.refinery=Processes one input fluid into up to three refinery products.\n\nMultiblock IO:\n- Fluid input: source tank\n- Fluid outputs: product tanks 1-3\n- Energy: accepted through energy valves
ui.aoc:info.greenhouse=Grows crops using seeds, soil, energy, water, and fertilizer.\n\nSlots:\n- Four seed inputs\n- One soil slot below the arrow\n- Nine output slots\n\nEach harvest uses 500 mB of fertilizer and 250 mB of water. Accepts organic, enriched, or industrial fertilizer.\n\nAccepted soils: dirt, grass block, and yellow, red, blue, or black soil. Soil affects energy cost and crop yield.\n\nStorage:\n- Energy: 200,000 DE\n- Fertilizer: 64,000 mB\n- Water: 64,000 mB
ui.aoc:info.fuel_burner=Burns stored liquid fuel to generate §eDE§r.\n\nMultiblock IO:\n- Fluid input: fuel tank\n- Energy: exported through energy valves
ui.aoc:info.fluid_storage=Stores up to seven fluids in independent tanks.\n\nMultiblock IO:\n- Each fluid valve can target Any Tank or a specific tank 1-7\n- Every tank supports input and output
ui.aoc:io.fuel_mixer.liquids=IO Modes:\n§r- §9Input Tank 1\n§r- §9Input Tank 2\n§r- §cOutput Tank
